B.aiF=new A.cH("The Elevo Platform",null)
B.aj7=new A.cW("A Saudi platform for managing and documenting teachers' professional achievements, designed to turn scattered manual effort in tracking activities and achievements into one organized, easy system.",null)
B.aiP=new A.cH("The Problem We Solve",null)
B.ajl=new A.cW("Documenting teachers' achievements is often done with paper files or scattered spreadsheets, wasting time on gathering and formatting, and making it hard to track approvals and prepare reports at the end of a semester or year.",null)
B.aim=new A.cH("How the Platform Works",null)
B.ai_=new A.dd("The teacher adds their work and documents it with photos and files directly from their device.",null)
B.ahK=new A.dd("The head teacher approves activities, manages sections and items, and tracks statistics.",null)
B.ahT=new A.dd("Reports are automatically generated as ready-to-submit PDF files.",null)
B.ai5=new A.dd("Each organization operates in a fully independent workspace with its own data and branding.",null)
B.ai7=new A.cH("Who This Platform Is For",null)
B.ajA=new A.cW("Schools, colleges and universities, training centers, government educational bodies, and independent teachers who want to document their work professionally.",null)
B.aiD=new A.cH("Our Commitment",null)
B.aj4=new A.cW("Privacy of every organization's data, a clear interface that doesn't require lengthy training, and continuous development driven by real user feedback.",null)
