B.ajs=new A.cW('By using the "Elevo" platform, you agree to the terms outlined on this page.',null)
B.aid=new A.cH("Nature of the Service",null)
B.ajE=new A.cW('"Elevo" is a platform for managing and documenting teachers\' professional achievements within educational institutions: submitting activities, approving them, calculating points, and generating reports.',null)
B.aiQ=new A.cH("Account & Permissions",null)
B.ahv=new A.dd("Each account is linked to a specific organization and workspace, and is created via an invite from a higher tier.",null)
B.ahO=new A.dd("You are responsible for keeping your password confidential and for everything done through your account.",null)
B.ahB=new A.dd("Your invite link may not be shared with anyone else.",null)
B.aiM=new A.cH("Content You Upload",null)
B.ajp=new A.cW("Ownership of the content you upload remains with you and your organization. You warrant that you have the right to upload this content, and that it does not violate any third-party rights or applicable regulations.",null)
B.aiV=new A.cH("Acceptable Use",null)
B.ahJ=new A.dd("Do not upload content that violates regulations, is offensive, or is unrelated to professional work.",null)
B.ahX=new A.dd("Do not attempt to access another organization's or user's data.",null)
B.ahU=new A.dd("Do not misuse the service in a way that disrupts it for other users.",null)
B.air=new A.cH("Subscriptions",null)
B.ajq=new A.cW("The platform operates on a per-organization subscription model, and usage limits (number of teachers and workspaces) are determined by the chosen plan. When a subscription expires, some services may be restricted until renewal. Pricing and duration details are shown on the subscription page.",null)
B.aiJ=new A.cH("Service Suspension",null)
B.aiZ=new A.cW("The platform administration reserves the right to suspend any account or organization for violating these terms, with notice given to the organization.",null)
B.aip=new A.cH("Limitation of Liability",null)
B.ajb=new A.cW("We strive to provide the service in the best possible way, but we do not guarantee it will be free of technical interruptions. We recommend keeping your own backup copies of important files as well.",null)
B.aiw=new A.cH("Changes to These Terms",null)
B.ajB=new A.cW("These terms may be updated as the platform evolves, and the update will appear on this page.",null)
