B.aj_=new A.cW('At the "Elevo" platform, we respect every user\'s privacy. This page explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how we store it.',null)
B.aiS=new A.cH("Data We Collect",null)
B.ahV=new A.dd("Account data: name, email, specialization, and educational institution name.",null)
B.ahs=new A.dd("Activity and achievement data entered by the teacher: title, description, objectives, date, and points.",null)
B.ahM=new A.dd("Files uploaded as achievement documentation: images, videos, PDFs, and other documents.",null)
B.ahG=new A.dd("An administrative activity log (e.g. creating an organization or changing a subscription) for tracking and review purposes.",null)
B.ai8=new A.cH("How We Use the Data",null)
B.aje=new A.cW("Data is used exclusively to run the platform's services: displaying achievements, approval by the supervisor, calculating points, and generating reports. We never sell your data or share it with commercial third parties for marketing purposes.",null)
B.aiq=new A.cH("Per-Organization Data Isolation",null)
B.ajc=new A.cW("Each organization operates within a separate workspace, and no organization can access another organization's data. This isolation is enforced at the database level, not just the interface level.",null)
B.aij=new A.cH("Payment Data",null)
B.aja=new A.cW('All payments are processed through Thawani, the approved Omani payment gateway. Your bank card details are entered directly on Thawani\'s secure, encrypted page and are handled entirely by Thawani. We at "Elevo" never see, receive, or store your card number or its sensitive details on our systems; we only keep a record of the transaction amount, date, status, and the Thawani session id for subscription and billing purposes.',null)
B.ail=new A.cH("Hosting & Data Security",null)
B.aj5=new A.cW("Data is stored on Supabase (managed PostgreSQL databases), and transmitted over an encrypted (HTTPS) connection. Access to data is restricted by the account's role within the platform.",null)
B.aiE=new A.cH("Your Rights",null)
B.ahH=new A.dd("Request access to your stored personal data.",null)
B.ahP=new A.dd("Request correction of any inaccurate data.",null)
B.ai0=new A.dd("Request deletion of your account and data.",null)
B.ajt=new A.cW('To exercise any of these rights, contact us via the "Contact Us" page and we will process your request.',null)
B.aio=new A.cH("Updates to This Policy",null)
B.ajz=new A.cW("We may update this policy as new services are added. Updates will appear on this page, and we recommend reviewing it periodically.",null)
